meta {
  name: Notification preferences
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/notifications/preferences
}

docs {
  Mandatory events are listed but cannot be switched off — a verification code
  nobody receives is an account nobody can get into, and a deletion notice a
  hijacked session has opted out of is the whole problem. They are shown as
  fixed rather than as a switch that silently ignores the tap.
}
